{"model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","subject_key":"ap-calculus-ab","topic_code":"1.9","key":"A","flags":[],"solve":{"ok":true,"object":{"answer":"A","ambiguous":false,"work":"As $x$ approaches 1 from both the left ($0.9, 0.99, 0.999$) and the right ($1.1, 1.01, 1.001$), $g(x)$ approaches 5. Therefore, $\\lim_{x \\to 1} g(x) = 5$. Since $g(1) = 2$, which does not equal the limit value of 5, the function has a removable discontinuity at $x = 1$. Graphically, this corresponds to an open circle at $(1, 5)$ and a solid/filled dot at $(1, 2)$."},"usage":{"inputTokens":436,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":436,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":501,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":168,"reasoningTokens":333},"totalTokens":937,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":333,"promptTokenCount":436,"candidatesTokenCount":168,"totalTokenCount":937,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":436}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":168}]},"reasoningTokens":333,"cachedInputTokens":0},"ms":4209},"audit":{"ok":true,"object":{"key_correct":true,"key_issue":"","choices":[{"choice_key":"A","rationale_accurate":true,"issue":""},{"choice_key":"B","rationale_accurate":true,"issue":""},{"choice_key":"C","rationale_accurate":true,"issue":""},{"choice_key":"D","rationale_accurate":true,"issue":""}],"scope_verdict":"fully_in_scope","out_of_scope_concepts":[],"on_topic":true,"needs_figure_or_calculator":false,"style_notes":[]},"usage":{"inputTokens":22004,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":22004,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":718,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":214,"reasoningTokens":504},"totalTokens":22722,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":504,"promptTokenCount":22004,"candidatesTokenCount":214,"totalTokenCount":22722,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":22004}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":214}]},"reasoningTokens":504,"cachedInputTokens":0},"ms":7048},"at":"2026-10