{"model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro","subject_key":"ap-calculus-ab","topic_code":"1.12","key":"C","flags":[],"solve":{"ok":true,"object":{"answer":"C","ambiguous":false,"work":"Option C is f(x)=1/(x^2-2x-8)=1/[(x-4)(x+2)]. Its only discontinuities are at x=4 and x=-2, neither of which lies in [-1,3], so f is continuous on the entire interval. Option A has a discontinuity at x=2, which is in [-1,3]. Option B is not defined for negative x, so it fails on [-1,0). Option D has a jump at x=1 because the left limit is 1 but f(1)=2."},"usage":{"inputTokens":367,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":367,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":544,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":133,"reasoningTokens":411},"totalTokens":911,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":367,"completion_tokens":544,"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":0,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":367,"total_tokens":911,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":411}},"reasoningTokens":411,"cachedInputTokens":0},"ms":5415},"audit":{"ok":true,"object":{"key_correct":true,"key_issue":"","choices":[{"choice_key":"A","rationale_accurate":true,"issue":""},{"choice_key":"B","rationale_accurate":true,"issue":""},{"choice_key":"C","rationale_accurate":true,"issue":""},{"choice_key":"D","rationale_accurate":true,"issue":""}],"scope_verdict":"fully_in_scope","out_of_scope_concepts":[],"on_topic":true,"needs_figure_or_calculator":false,"style_notes":["The correct choice's rationale uses a concise explanatory form rather than the 'Tempting... Fix:' pattern used in the other choices."]},"usage":{"inputTokens":20693,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":8533,"cacheReadTokens":12160},"outputTokens":2705,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":211,"reasoningTokens":2494},"totalTokens":23398,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":20693,"completion_tokens":2705,"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":12160,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":8533,"total_tokens":23398,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":12160},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":